Portions of the upstream guides derive from MDN Web Docs (Mozilla contributors)
and the W3C, WHATWG and IETF specifications, per the upstream README.

Changes made here:
- Only the guides listed in SKILL.md were copied; the rest of the upstream repository,
  the npx CLI, its search model and the plugin manifests are not included.
- SKILL.md is written for this repository and replaces the upstream SKILL.md.
- Guides whose first line is an HTML comment starting "Modified from" had their
  `npx -y modern-web-guidance@latest retrieve "<id>"` cross-references replaced with
  plain guide ids. All other guide files are unmodified copies.
